      <note type="generalNote">
        <p>Texas A&amp;M Women's soccer began as a club sport in 1977. It was recognized, officially, as a varsity sport in 1992. The Aggies were led by head coach Gerald Guerrieri. They have ten conference championship titles and five conference tournament titles. They have participated in the NCAA tournament every year since being recognized as a varsity sport.</p>
      </note>
